@startuml
title D-07 Degraded Resolve and Continuity Sequence
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam wrapWidth 220

actor "Operator / Supervisor" as Supervisor
actor "Cashier / Parker" as User
participant "Channel or Continuity Terminal" as Terminal
participant "Central PMS" as Central
participant "Vendor PMS / HCP" as Vendor
participant "Projection / Freshness Context" as Projection
participant "Operator Console" as Console
participant "Site POS Server" as POS
participant "Gate / Exit" as Gate
participant "Reconciliation / Audit" as Recon

Terminal -> Central : request session resolve
Central -> Vendor : live resolve attempt
Vendor --> Central : unavailable / unsafe / stale response
Central -> Projection : evaluate projection and freshness
Projection --> Central : freshness and degraded-use evidence

alt approved degraded policy permits resolve
  Central -> Console : request/record continuity scope and governance
  Supervisor -> Console : approve or confirm activation where policy requires
  Console -> Recon : record incident, audit, reconciliation tags
  Central -> Terminal : allow restricted continuity workflow
  User -> Terminal : continue assisted degraded flow
  Terminal -> Central : submit payment-capable workflow under controls
  Central -> POS : request fiscal issuance if policy and POS path allow
  POS --> Central : fiscal status
  alt fiscal and exit eligibility satisfied
    Central -> Gate : issue Central PMS authorization
    Gate --> Central : gate outcome
  else fiscal/exit unsafe
    Central -> Console : fiscal exception or manual release governance
    Console -> Recon : keep exception open
  end
else unsafe or stale
  Central -> Terminal : fail closed / route to review
  Central -> Recon : record blocked degraded attempt
end

Central -> Recon : post-restoration review required

note over Terminal
Continuity Terminal is disabled by default
and restricted to approved degraded/BCP controls.
end note

note over Projection
Projection supports degraded decisions only under policy.
It does not become tariff, payment, fiscal, or exit truth.
end note
@enduml
